      "message": "contrib: add deterministic fuzz coverage mode\n\nAdd an optional integer coverage_check argument to\ndeterministic-fuzz-coverage. Mode 0 runs both checks and preserves the\ncurrent default behavior. Mode 1 checks each corpus input individually.\nMode 2 checks all corpus inputs in a single process.\n\nThis makes it easier to distinguish per-input nondeterminism from\ncross-input state leakage. Good for debugging.",
